//! The `smg` binary's command line and the two paths from it to a running gateway.
//!
//! `CliArgs` flattens the flag groups (`RoutingArgs`, `WorkerArgs`, `DiscoveryArgs`, `ServingArgs`,
//! `ModelArgs`, `IntegrationArgs`). `to_router_config` builds `RouterConfig` through its hand-written
//! builder; `to_server_config` builds the `ServerConfig` literal that `server::startup` reads. A
//! listener-level setting needs both paths; a `RouterConfig` field rides nested in the second.
